    {
      "id": "9PiGeAzWOsqNgwS3OzAeK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13218.717468279125,
      "y": 1581.166888258163,
      "width": 190.70526325136552,
      "height": 8.151706565744782,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bnK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 871667531,
      "version": 517,
      "versionNonce": 1967607691,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792442370673,
      "created": 1792442204382,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "每个位置出的是 2 个\"分数\"不是\"二分类\",后面会沿 L 做softmax",
      "fontSize": 6.521365252595825,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "每个位置出的是 2 个\"分数\"不是\"二分类\",后面会沿 L 做softmax",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9bcdJCRBqAGEB1obQ7sLZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12188.438680255827,
      "y": 400.1311618795799,
      "width": 276.9044713340982,
      "height": 25.016044712538573,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bnL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1106318277,
      "version": 1609,
      "versionNonce": 1247745739,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792471748669,
      "created": 1792443238212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"15% 固定\"指的是比例固定，不是数量固定。每条句子按自己的长度算 15%，句子有长有短，\n挖出来的个数自然不一样多。损失按掩码屏蔽(（b,p,v）-> (b*p,v) 而label是(b,p) -> (b*p,) ,\n交叉熵reduction = 'none',则逐槽吐分(b*p,),最后凑数槽取0后加和再除以真槽位数 )。",
      "fontSize": 6.670945256676953,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"15% 固定\"指的是比例固定，不是数量固定。每条句子按自己的长度算 15%，句子有长有短，挖出来的个数自然不一样多。损失按掩码屏蔽(（b,p,v）-> (b*p,v) 而label是(b,p) -> (b*p,) , 交叉熵reduction = 'none',则逐槽吐分(b*p,),最后凑数槽取0后加和再除以真槽位数 )。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
